{"id":"gewissen","lemma":"Gewissen","pos":"noun","rank":1167,"glosses":["conscience (moral sense or faculty)"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈvɪsən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/59/De-Gewissen.ogg/De-Gewissen.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Gewissens","plural":"Gewissen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich bin dein Gewissen.","en":"I'm your conscience.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe kein schlechtes Gewissen.","en":"I don't have a guilty conscience.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"no / not a"},{"g":"bad","l":"schlecht"},null]},{"text":"Ich hatte deswegen ein schlechtes Gewissen.","en":"I felt guilty about it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755983","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"therefore"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bad","l":"schlecht"},null]},{"text":"Ich will dir kein schlechtes Gewissen machen.","en":"I'm not trying to make you feel bad.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"no / not a"},{"g":"bad","l":"schlecht"},null,{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Wir haben ein ganz schlechtes Gewissen.","en":"We feel very bad.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"entire"},{"g":"bad","l":"schlecht"},null]}]}